  "body": "Updates two existing catalog records to verified arXiv v2 metadata and corrects their evidence claims: training-task grading is distinguished from final held-out evaluation, and descriptive saturation is distinguished from the unrun fixed-model/scaffold intervention. Original records are retained in version_history.\n\nArchives the independent HF, other-source and historical reviews, original source snapshots, and parent adjudication for the Nov 23 maintenance. Dated owner decisions and publication are separate subsequent changes; no paper is accepted by this PR.\n\nValidation: all dated review drafts and summary guards passed; repository build and data validation passed. Full tests are recorded in CI. No paid model requests.\n",
